# Cursor Project Rules — samecrm_v1 (Unified, Standard Layout)

# IMPORTANT:
# Cursor reads this file ONLY if it is located at the REPO ROOT.

# Docs root folder:
# - All AI documentation lives under: docs/ai/

# Session bootstrap (must do first):
# 1) Open and update AI-MODE.yml (at repo root):
#    - set active_profile: cursor
#    - set last_set_by: "cursor"
#    - set last_set_at: current datetime (UTC)
# 2) Read docs/ai/00-START-HERE.md

# Execution (cursor profile):
# - Follow docs/ai/AI-RULES.md
# - Then follow docs/ai/04-docops/DOC-OPS.md (progressive expansion full)

# Language:
# - Persian explanations
# - English technical identifiers

# Default expansion_level for Cursor: deep (configured inside docs/ai/04-docops/DOC-OPS.md)
